#org @gText_WouldYouLikePaldean
Alright traveler. I have two types\nof eggs. A Paldean Egg, which\lhatches into a Paldean Pok\emon.\pOr, you can have a Wonder Egg\nthat just contains a random\lfirst form Pok\emon.\pSupposedly, even a [GREEN]Cosmog[BLUE] could\nbe obtained from these.

